  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.05 Chemigation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.05 \"Chemigation\" means the application of a chemical through an irrigation system by injecting or introducing the chemical into the water flowing through the system.\n\nSource. #5734, eff 11-5-93; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (formerly Pes 101.045)",
